                        "custom_class": "c",
                        "text": "<p><strong>We are open to a variety of B2B opportunities and requests!</strong> If you're looking for a reliable partner visit our B2B page and contact us for more details :)</p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "normal",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "custom",
                        "font": "var(--font-subheading--family)",
                        "font_size": "1.25rem",
                        "line_height": "loose",
                        "letter_spacing": "normal",
                        "case": "none",
                        "wrap": "pretty",
                        "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                        "background": false,
                        "background_color": "#00000026",
                        "corner_radius": 0,
                        "padding-block-start": 0,
                        "padding-block-end": 0,
                        "padding-inline-start": 0,
                        "padding-inline-end": 0
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text_GRgRtP"
                  ]
                },
                "accordion_row_yTMzVE": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "What are the dice made of?",
                    "open_by_default": true
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_wWHWcC": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "enable_custom_font": false,
                        "custom_class": "c",
                        "text": "<p>Clear epoxy resin, hand-poured and hand-polished, then inked so the numbers stay readable. These are sharp edge dice, and most sets carry a liquid core that shifts while the die rolls.</p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "normal",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "custom",
                        "font": "var(--font-subheading--family)",
                        "font_size": "1.25rem",
                        "line_height": "loose",
                        "letter_spacing": "normal",
                        "case": "none",
                        "wrap": "pretty",
                        "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                        "background": false,
                        "background_color": "#00000026",
                        "corner_radius": 0,
                        "padding-block-start": 0,
                        "padding-block-end": 0,
                        "padding-inline-start": 0,
                        "padding-inline-end": 0
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text_wWHWcC"
                  ]
                },
                "accordion_row_XgIxxk": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Why do handmade dice cost more than a plastic set?",
                    "open_by_default": false
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_BPmfQw": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "enable_custom_font": false,
                        "custom_class": "c",
                        "text": "<p>Because a plastic set leaves an injection mould by the thousand, and a resin set leaves a silicone mould one pour at a time. Every die is then demoulded, sanded, polished and inked by hand. That work is the whole price difference, and it is also why no two sets come out quite the same.</p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "normal",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "custom",
                        "font": "var(--font-subheading--family)",
                        "font_size": "1.25rem",
                        "line_height": "loose",
                        "letter_spacing": "normal",
                        "case": "none",
                        "wrap": "pretty",
                        "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                        "background": false,
                        "background_color": "#00000026",
                        "corner_radius": 0,
                        "padding-block-start": 0,
                        "padding-block-end": 0,
                        "padding-inline-start": 0,
                        "padding-inline-end": 0
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text_BPmfQw"
                  ]
                },
                "accordion_row_oDLGeX": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Do the sets have all seven dice?",
                    "open_by_default": false
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_IpUrki": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "enable_custom_font": false,
                        "custom_class": "c",
                        "text": "<p>Yes. D20, D12, D10, percentile D10, D8, D6 and D4, the full set a 5e table needs. A soft velvet bag comes with every order.</p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "normal",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "custom",
                        "font": "var(--font-subheading--family)",
                        "font_size": "1.25rem",
                        "line_height": "loose",
                        "letter_spacing": "normal",
                        "case": "none",
                        "wrap": "pretty",
                        "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                        "background": false,
                        "background_color": "#00000026",
                        "corner_radius": 0,
                        "padding-block-start": 0,
                        "padding-block-end": 0,
                        "padding-inline-start": 0,
                        "padding-inline-end": 0
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text_IpUrki"
                  ]
                },
                "accordion_row_eUEVXZ": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "When do the dice ship?",
                    "open_by_default": false
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_eHpZsR": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "enable_custom_font": false,
                        "custom_class": "c",
                        "text": "<p>Dice come from stock, so there is no five to seven day print queue in front of them the way there is with our miniatures. If a set shows as available, it leaves with your order. If it shows as sold out, it is genuinely gone until the next pour. Delivery time then depends on where you are.</p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "normal",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "custom",
                        "font": "var(--font-subheading--family)",
                        "font_size": "1.25rem",
                        "line_height": "loose",
                        "letter_spacing": "normal",
                        "case": "none",
                        "wrap": "pretty",
                        "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                        "background": false,
